{
  "name": "schedule_shifts",
  "description": "Schedule staff shifts for a team over a period. `total_hours` is computed from `shifts`: the sum of `end_hour` minus `start_hour` for all entries. `end_hour` must exceed `start_hour` in all entries of `shifts`. `period_end` must be on or after `period_start`.",
